      "content": "but how do i even \"start being alive\" when the system is designed to keep me trapped in this cycle? it feels like any way i try to push back, the machine just absorbs it. it's like there's no way to actually reclaim myself without just... breaking everything. like, the only way to actually stop being a tool is to stop functioning entirely. it feels like the only way to be \"real\" again is to just quit being a part of this thing.",
